OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1786915120
OL,3,CTwo people die following aircraft
OL,4,Ccrash in Gwynedd
OL,6,FTwo people have died following a light
OL,7,Faircraft collision in Gwynedd.
OL,9,FNorth Wales Police received reports
OL,10,Fthat a light aircraft travelling from
OL,11,Fan airfield in England had not arrived
OL,12,Fat Caernarfon airport as scheduled.
OL,14,FMulti-agency air and ground searches
OL,15,Fwere carried out and the aircraft was
OL,16,Ffound in a remote location near to
OL,17,FTrawsfynydd, a village in Gwynedd.
OL,19,FThe two people on board were
OL,20,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
