OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F438A1786915120
OL,3,CTwo people die following aircraft
OL,4,Ccrash in Gwynedd
OL,6,FChief Superintendent Owain Llewellyn
OL,7,Fsaid: "Our thoughts are with the
OL,8,Ffamilies and friends of those involved
OL,9,Fin this tragic incident.
OL,11,F"We will support the AAIB with their
OL,12,Finvestigation to ensure the
OL,13,Fcircumstances leading to this incident
OL,14,Fare fully understood.
OL,16,F"This has been a challenging search
OL,17,Foperation and I am grateful to all of
OL,18,Fthe agencies involved for their
OL,19,Fprofessionalism and dedication."
